# other 127 unverifiable entries removed 2026-09), retired rather than
# fixed in place — redirects to the real, evidence-based Eilat article
# created during the Warm Winter Destinations migration. See CHANGELOG.
/destinations/eilat /destinations/traveling-to-eilat-food-allergy-friendly-guide 301!

